,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":1,"total":9,"comments":null},{"game_id":33,"givenby":"FRA Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"Really fun and smily guys, calm despite a hard contact from our side"},{"game_id":43,"givenby":"SUI Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":42,"givenby":"GBR Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"Really nice team to play against - multiple instances of accepting calls after discussing it and very positive and happy on the sideline"},{"game_id":44,"givenby":"SGP Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":"I think the only issue we had was the contact on the mark, especially regarding the wrapping and straddling calls. Also slightly high contact during the matchups, such as the swiping, but was quickly resolved. However, the calls made were all talked out really well, with both sides listening to each others perspectives and then resolving the calls. We really appreciate the high levels of communication. Thank you Australia for the intense game!"},{"game_id":144,"givenby":"IRL Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":3,"total":10,"comments":"thank you for the game!"},{"game_id":142,"givenby":"NZL Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":143,"givenby":"CHN Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":145,"givenby":"GER Open U20","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":null}],"spiritstats":{"games":10},"spirittotal":{"total":105}}